{"scenes":[{"id":"opening:L1-1-1","characterId":"","title":"Chapter 1: Troublemaker — opening excerpt","category":"chapter","lines":[{"number":1,"nodeId":"L1-1-1","text":"Loud noises come from the direction of the apothecary.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:L1-1-1","speaker":null,"speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"L1-1-2","speakerRef":{"position":"mid"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"L1-1-1"}},{"number":2,"nodeId":"L1-1-2","text":"Get out, you fake potion peddler! If you don't, we'll trash your shop!","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:L1-1-2","speaker":"???","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"L1-1-3","speakerRef":{"position":"left"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"L1-1-2"}},{"number":3,"nodeId":"L1-1-3","text":"It's... It's the adventurers...","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:L1-1-3","speaker":"Maxim","speakerArt":"/assets/roster/hero_2.webp","choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"L1-1-4","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"hero_02"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"L1-1-3"}}],"excerpt":true,"root":"L1-1-1","owner":"1-1","omittedNext":["L1-1-4"],"sourceField":"LevelNormal.dialogue","speakerPolicy":"explicit current node only; no inherited NPC identity"},{"id":"opening:L2-0-1","characterId":"","title":"Chapter 2: Unconscious Girl — opening excerpt","category":"chapter","lines":[{"number":1,"nodeId":"L2-0-1","text":"The workshop has opened for business. You decide to go see how operations there are going.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:L2-0-1","speaker":null,"speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"L2-0-2","speakerRef":{"position":"mid"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"L2-0-1"}},{"number":2,"nodeId":"L2-0-2","text":"How's business in the workshop?","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:L2-0-2","speaker":"{playerName}","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"L2-0-3","speakerRef":{"speaker":1,"speakerImg":"Icon_Story_Me_1","position":"mid"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"L2-0-2"}},{"number":3,"nodeId":"L2-0-3","text":"Not bad. We sell farm tools and furniture pretty well, enough to make a small profit.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:L2-0-3","speaker":"Belle","speakerArt":"/assets/roster/hero_12.webp","choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"L2-0-4","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"hero_12"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"L2-0-3"}}],"excerpt":true,"root":"L2-0-1","owner":"2-1","omittedNext":["L2-0-4"],"sourceField":"LevelNormal.dialogue","speakerPolicy":"explicit current node only; no inherited NPC identity"},{"id":"opening:L3-0-1","characterId":"","title":"Chapter 3: Lone Wolf Brings News — opening excerpt","category":"chapter","lines":[{"number":1,"nodeId":"L3-0-1","text":"Several days later...","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:L3-0-1","speaker":null,"speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"L3-0-2","speakerRef":{"position":"mid"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_VillageGate","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"L3-0-1"}},{"number":2,"nodeId":"L3-0-2","text":"{playerName}, I'm back.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:L3-0-2","speaker":"Knivi","speakerArt":"/assets/roster/hero_4.webp","choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"L3-0-3","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"hero_04"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_VillageGate","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"L3-0-2"}},{"number":3,"nodeId":"L3-0-3","text":"I've gathered some information...","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:L3-0-3","speaker":"Knivi","speakerArt":"/assets/roster/hero_4.webp","choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"L3-0-4","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"hero_04"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_VillageGate","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"L3-0-3"}}],"excerpt":true,"root":"L3-0-1","owner":"3-1","omittedNext":["L3-0-4"],"sourceField":"LevelNormal.dialogue","speakerPolicy":"explicit current node only; no inherited NPC identity"},{"id":"opening:L4-0-1","characterId":"","title":"Chapter 4: Truth Revealed — opening excerpt","category":"chapter","lines":[{"number":1,"nodeId":"L4-0-1","text":"The apothecary officially began selling the attack potions.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:L4-0-1","speaker":null,"speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"L4-0-2","speakerRef":{"position":"mid"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Pharmacy","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"L4-0-1"}},{"number":2,"nodeId":"L4-0-2","text":"A large number of adventurers were attracted by your bizarre strategy and soon a queue formed of eager buyers.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:L4-0-2","speaker":null,"speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"L4-0-3","speakerRef":{"position":"mid"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Pharmacy","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"L4-0-2"}},{"number":3,"nodeId":"L4-0-3","text":"So many people~","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:L4-0-3","speaker":"Reir","speakerArt":"/assets/roster/hero_3.webp","choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"L4-0-4","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"hero_03"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Pharmacy","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"L4-0-3"}}],"excerpt":true,"root":"L4-0-1","owner":"4-1","omittedNext":["L4-0-4"],"sourceField":"LevelNormal.dialogue","speakerPolicy":"explicit current node only; no inherited NPC identity"},{"id":"opening:L5-1-1","characterId":"","title":"Chapter 5: Drakenberg — opening excerpt","category":"chapter","lines":[{"number":1,"nodeId":"L5-1-1","text":"In Drakenberg, the variety of vendors and shops is enough to make your head spin.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:L5-1-1","speaker":null,"speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"L5-1-2","speakerRef":{"position":"mid"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_DragonCity","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"L5-1-1"}},{"number":2,"nodeId":"L5-1-2","text":"Selling wild game, fresh wild game!","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:L5-1-2","speaker":"Bear Tribe Hunter","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"L5-1-3","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"hero_11"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_DragonCity","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"L5-1-2"}},{"number":3,"nodeId":"L5-1-3","text":"Bread here~ Hot and steaming, freshly baked!","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:L5-1-3","speaker":"Shiba Inu Baker","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"L5-1-4","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"hero_16"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_DragonCity","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"L5-1-3"}}],"excerpt":true,"root":"L5-1-1","owner":"5-1","omittedNext":["L5-1-4"],"sourceField":"LevelNormal.dialogue","speakerPolicy":"explicit current node only; no inherited NPC identity"},{"id":"opening:L6-1-1","characterId":"","title":"Chapter 6: Onslaught of Malice — opening excerpt","category":"chapter","lines":[{"number":1,"nodeId":"L6-1-1","text":"You successfully establish a relationship with Ira and decide to return to the village.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:L6-1-1","speaker":null,"speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"L6-1-2","speakerRef":{"position":"mid"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_DragonCity","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"L6-1-1"}},{"number":2,"nodeId":"L6-1-2","text":"Stop following me, are you going to come back with me or something?","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:L6-1-2","speaker":"{playerName}","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"L6-1-3","speakerRef":{"speaker":1,"speakerImg":"Icon_Story_Me_1","position":"left"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_DragonCity","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"L6-1-2"}},{"number":3,"nodeId":"L6-1-3","text":"I want hamburgers... Yummy, yummy hamburgers...","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:L6-1-3","speaker":"Ira","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"L6-1-4","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"hero_158_pre"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_DragonCity","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"L6-1-3"}}],"excerpt":true,"root":"L6-1-1","owner":"6-1","omittedNext":["L6-1-4"],"sourceField":"LevelNormal.dialogue","speakerPolicy":"explicit current node only; no inherited NPC identity"},{"id":"opening:L1BossWin_Dialogue1","characterId":"","title":"Chapter 1: Troublemaker — victory line","category":"chapter","lines":[{"number":1,"nodeId":"L1BossWin_Dialogue1","text":"Your story is so interesting~","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:L1BossWin_Dialogue1","speaker":null,"speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":null,"speakerRef":{},"presentation":{"voiceID":"L1BossWin_Dialogue1"}}],"excerpt":false,"root":"L1BossWin_Dialogue1","owner":"1-6-0","omittedNext":[],"sourceField":"LevelBoss.battleEndDialogue","speakerPolicy":"explicit current node only; no inherited NPC identity"},{"id":"opening:L2BossWin_Dialogue1","characterId":"","title":"Chapter 2: Unconscious Girl — victory line","category":"chapter","lines":[{"number":1,"nodeId":"L2BossWin_Dialogue1","text":"Sorry, I’ve never seen this person before.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:L2BossWin_Dialogue1","speaker":null,"speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":null,"speakerRef":{},"presentation":{"voiceID":"L2BossWin_Dialogue1"}}],"excerpt":false,"root":"L2BossWin_Dialogue1","owner":"2-6-0","omittedNext":[],"sourceField":"LevelBoss.battleEndDialogue","speakerPolicy":"explicit current node only; no inherited NPC identity"},{"id":"opening:L3BossWin_Dialogue1","characterId":"","title":"Chapter 3: Lone Wolf Brings News — victory line","category":"chapter","lines":[{"number":1,"nodeId":"L3BossWin_Dialogue1","text":"I think I understood some of that...","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:L3BossWin_Dialogue1","speaker":null,"speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":null,"speakerRef":{},"presentation":{"voiceID":"L3BossWin_Dialogue1"}}],"excerpt":false,"root":"L3BossWin_Dialogue1","owner":"3-6-0","omittedNext":[],"sourceField":"LevelBoss.battleEndDialogue","speakerPolicy":"explicit current node only; no inherited NPC identity"},{"id":"opening:L4BossWin_Dialogue1","characterId":"","title":"Chapter 4: Truth Revealed — victory line","category":"chapter","lines":[{"number":1,"nodeId":"L4BossWin_Dialogue1","text":"Stop, stop, I surrender!","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:L4BossWin_Dialogue1","speaker":null,"speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":null,"speakerRef":{},"presentation":{"voiceID":"L4BossWin_Dialogue1"}}],"excerpt":false,"root":"L4BossWin_Dialogue1","owner":"4-6-0","omittedNext":[],"sourceField":"LevelBoss.battleEndDialogue","speakerPolicy":"explicit current node only; no inherited NPC identity"},{"id":"opening:L5BossWin_Dialogue1","characterId":"","title":"Chapter 5: Drakenberg — victory line","category":"chapter","lines":[{"number":1,"nodeId":"L5BossWin_Dialogue1","text":"Not bad, you're pretty strong!","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:L5BossWin_Dialogue1","speaker":null,"speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":null,"speakerRef":{},"presentation":{"voiceID":"L5BossWin_Dialogue1"}}],"excerpt":false,"root":"L5BossWin_Dialogue1","owner":"5-6-0","omittedNext":[],"sourceField":"LevelBoss.battleEndDialogue","speakerPolicy":"explicit current node only; no inherited NPC identity"},{"id":"opening:L6BossWin_Dialogue1","characterId":"","title":"Chapter 6: Onslaught of Malice — victory line","category":"chapter","lines":[{"number":1,"nodeId":"L6BossWin_Dialogue1","text":"*Crying* But I don't wanna do a handstand...","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:L6BossWin_Dialogue1","speaker":null,"speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":null,"speakerRef":{},"presentation":{"voiceID":"L6BossWin_Dialogue1"}}],"excerpt":false,"root":"L6BossWin_Dialogue1","owner":"6-6-0","omittedNext":[],"sourceField":"LevelBoss.battleEndDialogue","speakerPolicy":"explicit current node only; no inherited NPC identity"},{"id":"opening:CityEvent1-1","characterId":"hero_1","title":"Fifi’s arrival","category":"arrival","lines":[{"number":1,"nodeId":"CityEvent1-1","text":"It's time to repay the debt. The usurious merchant arrives on schedule.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent1-1","speaker":null,"speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEvent1-2","speakerRef":{"position":"mid"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Tavern1","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"CityEvent1-1"}},{"number":2,"nodeId":"CityEvent1-2","text":"How's it going, little one? Making money is hard, isn't it? You didn’t make enough money this time, did you?","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent1-2","speaker":"Creos","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEvent1-3","speakerRef":{"position":"right","rightCharId":"dialog_npc_03"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Tavern1","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"CityEvent1-2"}},{"number":3,"nodeId":"CityEvent1-3","text":"If you can't pay back the money, the inn will belong to me, and even your walking mushroom pet will belong to me!","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent1-3","speaker":"Creos","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":"Take out 2000 gold","nextNode":"CityEvent1-4","speakerRef":{"position":"right","rightCharId":"dialog_npc_03"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Tavern1","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"CityEvent1-3","choice":"1"}},{"number":4,"nodeId":"CityEvent1-4","text":"Here, 2000 gold coins. We don’t owe you anything now.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent1-4","speaker":"Fifi","speakerArt":"/assets/roster/hero_1.webp","choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEvent1-5","speakerRef":{"position":"left","leftCharId":"hero_01","rightCharId":"dialog_npc_03"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Tavern1","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"CityEvent1-4"}},{"number":5,"nodeId":"CityEvent1-5","text":"W-what?! Where did you get the money from?","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent1-5","speaker":"Creos","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEvent1-6","speakerRef":{"position":"right","leftCharId":"hero_01","rightCharId":"dialog_npc_03"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Tavern1","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"CityEvent1-5"}},{"number":6,"nodeId":"CityEvent1-6","text":"In just ten days? Impossible! There must be something up with this money... (grabs the coins and tests them repeatedly).\nThey’re all genuine...","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent1-6","speaker":"Creos","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEvent1-7","speakerRef":{"position":"right","leftCharId":"hero_01","rightCharId":"dialog_npc_03"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Tavern1","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"CityEvent1-6"}},{"number":7,"nodeId":"CityEvent1-7","text":"Look at your face, you didn't have good intentions from the beginning!","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent1-7","speaker":"{playerName}","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEvent1-8","speakerRef":{"speaker":1,"speakerImg":"Icon_Story_Me_6","position":"mid","leftCharId":"hero_01","rightCharId":"dialog_npc_03"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Tavern1","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"CityEvent1-7"}},{"number":8,"nodeId":"CityEvent1-8","text":"You deliberately set a trap in the contract and set high interest rates...","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent1-8","speaker":"{playerName}","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEvent1-9","speakerRef":{"speaker":1,"speakerImg":"Icon_Story_Me_6","position":"mid","leftCharId":"hero_01","rightCharId":"dialog_npc_03"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Tavern1","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"CityEvent1-8"}},{"number":9,"nodeId":"CityEvent1-9","text":"Just so Fifi and Belle couldn't pay off their debt and you can take over their inn. After they worked so hard!","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent1-9","speaker":"{playerName}","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEvent1-10","speakerRef":{"speaker":1,"speakerImg":"Icon_Story_Me_6","position":"mid","leftCharId":"hero_01","rightCharId":"dialog_npc_03"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Tavern1","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"CityEvent1-9"}},{"number":10,"nodeId":"CityEvent1-10","text":"This time I carefully checked the contract—you have no excuse to come and ask us for money again. Now get out of here.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent1-10","speaker":"Belle","speakerArt":"/assets/roster/hero_12.webp","choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEvent1-11","speakerRef":{"position":"left","leftCharId":"hero_12","rightCharId":"dialog_npc_03"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Tavern1","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"CityEvent1-10"}},{"number":11,"nodeId":"CityEvent1-11","text":"Y-You...!","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent1-11","speaker":"Creos","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEvent1-12","speakerRef":{"position":"right","leftCharId":"hero_12","rightCharId":"dialog_npc_03"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Tavern1","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"CityEvent1-11"}},{"number":12,"nodeId":"CityEvent1-12","text":"The young lady asked you to leave, so stop annoying her and leave.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent1-12","speaker":"{playerName}","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEvent1-13","speakerRef":{"speaker":1,"speakerImg":"Icon_Story_Me_4","position":"mid","leftCharId":"hero_12","rightCharId":"dialog_npc_03"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Tavern1","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"CityEvent1-12"}},{"number":13,"nodeId":"CityEvent1-13","text":"You stupid walking mushroom... How dare you speak to me like that?! Just wait, this isn’t over. We’ll meet again!","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent1-13","speaker":"Creos","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEvent1-14","speakerRef":{"position":"right","leftCharId":"hero_12","rightCharId":"dialog_npc_03"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Tavern1","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"CityEvent1-13"}},{"number":14,"nodeId":"CityEvent1-14","text":"Creos left in a rage.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent1-14","speaker":null,"speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEvent1-15","speakerRef":{"position":"mid"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Tavern1","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"CityEvent1-14"}},{"number":15,"nodeId":"CityEvent1-15","text":"Dear {playerName}, thank you so much. Belle and I can manage our inn in peace now.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent1-15","speaker":"Fifi","speakerArt":"/assets/roster/hero_1.webp","choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEvent1-16","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"hero_01"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Tavern1","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"CityEvent1-15"}},{"number":16,"nodeId":"CityEvent1-16","text":"I have a request... Can I become your Fellow?","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent1-16","speaker":"Fifi","speakerArt":"/assets/roster/hero_1.webp","choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEvent1-17","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"hero_01"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Tavern1","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"CityEvent1-16"}},{"number":17,"nodeId":"CityEvent1-17","text":"What?","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent1-17","speaker":"{playerName}","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEvent1-18","speakerRef":{"speaker":1,"speakerImg":"Icon_Story_Me_5","position":"right","middleCharId":"hero_01"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Tavern1","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"CityEvent1-17"}},{"number":18,"nodeId":"CityEvent1-18","text":"After spending this time with you, I feel like I can trust you.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent1-18","speaker":"Fifi","speakerArt":"/assets/roster/hero_1.webp","choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEvent1-19","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"hero_01"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Tavern1","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"CityEvent1-18"}},{"number":19,"nodeId":"CityEvent1-19","text":"From now on, please let me work together with you.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent1-19","speaker":"Fifi","speakerArt":"/assets/roster/hero_1.webp","choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":null,"speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"hero_01"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Tavern1","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"CityEvent1-19"}}],"excerpt":false,"root":"CityEvent1-1","owner":"B2","omittedNext":[],"sourceField":"CityAssignEvent.dialog","speakerPolicy":"explicit current node only; no inherited NPC identity"},{"id":"opening:CityEventB4-1","characterId":"hero_2","title":"Maxim’s arrival","category":"arrival","lines":[{"number":1,"nodeId":"CityEventB4-1","text":"Here you are, Lord.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB4-1","speaker":"Maxim","speakerArt":"/assets/roster/hero_2.webp","choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB4-2","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"hero_02"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Pharmacy","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"CityEventB4-1"}},{"number":2,"nodeId":"CityEventB4-2","text":"Uh oh, did something happen to the apothecary again?","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB4-2","speaker":"{playerName}","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB4-3","speakerRef":{"speaker":1,"speakerImg":"Icon_Story_Me_1","position":"right","middleCharId":"hero_02"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Pharmacy","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"CityEventB4-2"}},{"number":3,"nodeId":"CityEventB4-3","text":"No, nothing like that, I just came to thank you.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB4-3","speaker":"Maxim","speakerArt":"/assets/roster/hero_2.webp","choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB4-4","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"hero_02"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Pharmacy","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"CityEventB4-3"}},{"number":4,"nodeId":"CityEventB4-4","text":"Thank you for keeping the apothecary open, still paying the employees, and even buying new materials.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB4-4","speaker":"Maxim","speakerArt":"/assets/roster/hero_2.webp","choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB4-5","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"hero_02"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Pharmacy","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"CityEventB4-4"}},{"number":5,"nodeId":"CityEventB4-5","text":"If it weren't for you, my dream might have already been shattered...","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB4-5","speaker":"Maxim","speakerArt":"/assets/roster/hero_2.webp","choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB4-6","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"hero_02"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Pharmacy","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"CityEventB4-5"}},{"number":6,"nodeId":"CityEventB4-6","text":"Don't mention it~ The apothecary can't do without Maxim either~","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB4-6","speaker":"{playerName}","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB4-7","speakerRef":{"speaker":1,"speakerImg":"Icon_Story_Me_2","position":"right","middleCharId":"hero_02"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Pharmacy","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"CityEventB4-6"}},{"number":7,"nodeId":"CityEventB4-7","text":"Don't worry, I'll take care of all of this and restore the apothecary to its normal operations~","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB4-7","speaker":"{playerName}","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB4-8","speakerRef":{"speaker":1,"speakerImg":"Icon_Story_Me_4","position":"right","middleCharId":"hero_02"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Pharmacy","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"CityEventB4-7"}},{"number":8,"nodeId":"CityEventB4-8","text":"Lord...!","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB4-8","speaker":"Maxim","speakerArt":"/assets/roster/hero_2.webp","choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB4-9","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"hero_02"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Pharmacy","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"CityEventB4-8"}},{"number":9,"nodeId":"CityEventB4-9","text":"No, just using words to thank you isn't enough. I want to become your Fellow to repay you!","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB4-9","speaker":"Maxim","speakerArt":"/assets/roster/hero_2.webp","choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":null,"speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"hero_02"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Pharmacy","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"CityEventB4-9"}}],"excerpt":false,"root":"CityEventB4-1","owner":"B4","omittedNext":[],"sourceField":"CityAssignEvent.dialog","speakerPolicy":"explicit current node only; no inherited NPC identity"},{"id":"opening:CityEvent2-1","characterId":"hero_4","title":"Knivi’s arrival","category":"arrival","lines":[{"number":1,"nodeId":"CityEvent2-1","text":"Such a wonderful village, everyone is so welcoming.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent2-1","speaker":"Knivi","speakerArt":"/assets/roster/hero_4.webp","choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEvent2-2","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"hero_04"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEvent2-1"}},{"number":2,"nodeId":"CityEvent2-2","text":"Hey, isn't this Knivi? Hi, have you been feeling comfortable in the village?","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent2-2","speaker":"{playerName}","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEvent2-3","speakerRef":{"speaker":1,"speakerImg":"Icon_Story_Me_2","position":"left","middleCharId":"hero_04"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEvent2-2"}},{"number":3,"nodeId":"CityEvent2-3","text":"Yes. Thank you for taking care of me all this time.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent2-3","speaker":"Knivi","speakerArt":"/assets/roster/hero_4.webp","choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEvent2-4","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"hero_04"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEvent2-3"}},{"number":4,"nodeId":"CityEvent2-4","text":"For the trouble I caused before. I'm sorry.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent2-4","speaker":"Knivi","speakerArt":"/assets/roster/hero_4.webp","choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEvent2-5","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"hero_04"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEvent2-4"}},{"number":5,"nodeId":"CityEvent2-5","text":"It's okay~ It was just a misunderstanding, and you meant well.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent2-5","speaker":"{playerName}","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEvent2-6","speakerRef":{"speaker":1,"speakerImg":"Icon_Story_Me_2","position":"left","middleCharId":"hero_04"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEvent2-5"}},{"number":6,"nodeId":"CityEvent2-6","text":"Thanks to your help, we solved the problem faster than expected.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent2-6","speaker":"{playerName}","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEvent2-7","speakerRef":{"speaker":1,"speakerImg":"Icon_Story_Me_2","position":"left","middleCharId":"hero_04"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEvent2-6"}},{"number":7,"nodeId":"CityEvent2-7","text":"For adventurers, nothing is more joyful than meeting like-minded companions.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent2-7","speaker":"Knivi","speakerArt":"/assets/roster/hero_4.webp","choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEvent2-8","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"hero_04"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEvent2-7"}},{"number":8,"nodeId":"CityEvent2-8","text":"I recognize your power, and admire your character.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent2-8","speaker":"Knivi","speakerArt":"/assets/roster/hero_4.webp","choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEvent2-9","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"hero_04"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEvent2-8"}},{"number":9,"nodeId":"CityEvent2-9","text":"I'd like to be part of your team. If I can, from now on I will lend a hand if you ever need anything.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent2-9","speaker":"Knivi","speakerArt":"/assets/roster/hero_4.webp","choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEvent2-10","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"hero_04"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEvent2-9"}},{"number":10,"nodeId":"CityEvent2-10","text":"What do you think? Will you accept me?","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent2-10","speaker":"Knivi","speakerArt":"/assets/roster/hero_4.webp","choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEvent2-11","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"hero_04"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEvent2-10"}},{"number":11,"nodeId":"CityEvent2-11","text":"If you're willing, then of course I'll accept you! There's no need to be so formal.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent2-11","speaker":"{playerName}","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEvent2-12","speakerRef":{"speaker":1,"speakerImg":"Icon_Story_Me_3","position":"left","middleCharId":"hero_04"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEvent2-11"}},{"number":12,"nodeId":"CityEvent2-12","text":"Like you said, we're becoming Fellows~","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent2-12","speaker":"{playerName}","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEvent2-13","speakerRef":{"speaker":1,"speakerImg":"Icon_Story_Me_4","position":"left","middleCharId":"hero_04"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEvent2-12"}},{"number":13,"nodeId":"CityEvent2-13","text":"Haha, you're right. In that case, I hope to learn a lot from you from now on, Fellow!","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEvent2-13","speaker":"Knivi","speakerArt":"/assets/roster/hero_4.webp","choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":null,"speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"hero_04"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEvent2-13"}}],"excerpt":false,"root":"CityEvent2-1","owner":"A2","omittedNext":[],"sourceField":"CityAssignEvent.dialog","speakerPolicy":"explicit current node only; no inherited NPC identity"},{"id":"opening:CityEventB3-1","characterId":"wife_1","title":"Gina’s arrival","category":"arrival","lines":[{"number":1,"nodeId":"CityEventB3-1","text":"It's alright now. You don't need to be scared anymore. You're free now.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB3-1","speaker":"{playerName}","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB3-2","speakerRef":{"speaker":1,"speakerImg":"Icon_Story_Me_1","position":"right","middleCharId":"dialog_npc_01"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEventB3-1"}},{"number":2,"nodeId":"CityEventB3-2","text":"You can stay at Fifi and Belle’s inn if you want...","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB3-2","speaker":"{playerName}","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB3-3","speakerRef":{"speaker":1,"speakerImg":"Icon_Story_Me_3","position":"right","middleCharId":"dialog_npc_01"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEventB3-2"}},{"number":3,"nodeId":"CityEventB3-3","text":"No, I don’t want to...","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB3-3","speaker":null,"speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB3-4","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"dialog_npc_01"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEventB3-3"}},{"number":4,"nodeId":"CityEventB3-4","text":"Huh? That's fine, if you don't like it here, then...","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB3-4","speaker":"{playerName}","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB3-5","speakerRef":{"speaker":1,"speakerImg":"Icon_Story_Me_2","position":"right","middleCharId":"dialog_npc_01"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEventB3-4"}},{"number":5,"nodeId":"CityEventB3-5","text":"Don't leave me! I'll be good! I'm sorry, but don't leave me behind!","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB3-5","speaker":null,"speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB3-6","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"dialog_npc_01"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEventB3-5"}},{"number":6,"nodeId":"CityEventB3-6","text":"Wh-what is happening?! No one wants to leave you...","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB3-6","speaker":"{playerName}","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB3-7","speakerRef":{"speaker":1,"speakerImg":"Icon_Story_Me_5","position":"right","middleCharId":"dialog_npc_01"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEventB3-6"}},{"number":7,"nodeId":"CityEventB3-7","text":"I'm sorry, I'm sorry! Please don't leave me alone, I don't want to go back, Master...","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB3-7","speaker":null,"speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB3-8","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"dialog_npc_01"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEventB3-7"}},{"number":8,"nodeId":"CityEventB3-8","text":"(What has she gone through to be like this? Hmm...)","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB3-8","speaker":"{playerName}","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB3-9","speakerRef":{"speaker":1,"speakerImg":"Icon_Story_Me_7","position":"right","middleCharId":"dialog_npc_01"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEventB3-8"}},{"number":9,"nodeId":"CityEventB3-9","text":"Relax, it's okay... What's your name?","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB3-9","speaker":"{playerName}","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB3-10","speakerRef":{"speaker":1,"speakerImg":"Icon_Story_Me_2","position":"right","middleCharId":"dialog_npc_01"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEventB3-9"}},{"number":10,"nodeId":"CityEventB3-10","text":"I don't know... I don't have a name...","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB3-10","speaker":null,"speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB3-11","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"dialog_npc_01"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEventB3-10"}},{"number":11,"nodeId":"CityEventB3-11","text":"I've always been a slave... I've been working since I remember. I’d get beaten if I didn’t...","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB3-11","speaker":null,"speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB3-12","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"dialog_npc_01"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEventB3-11"}},{"number":12,"nodeId":"CityEventB3-12","text":"(What a poor girl… I must help and protect her, not letting her become a slave again.)","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB3-12","speaker":"{playerName}","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB3-13","speakerRef":{"speaker":1,"speakerImg":"Icon_Story_Me_7","position":"right","middleCharId":"dialog_npc_01"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEventB3-12"}},{"number":13,"nodeId":"CityEventB3-13","text":"Nobody cares about me... except you... the one who saved me.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB3-13","speaker":null,"speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB3-14","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"dialog_npc_01"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEventB3-13"}},{"number":14,"nodeId":"CityEventB3-14","text":"Can I stay by your side?","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB3-14","speaker":null,"speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB3-15","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"dialog_npc_01"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEventB3-14"}},{"number":15,"nodeId":"CityEventB3-15","text":"Of course. But there's one condition.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB3-15","speaker":"{playerName}","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB3-16","speakerRef":{"speaker":1,"speakerImg":"Icon_Story_Me_1","position":"right","middleCharId":"dialog_npc_01"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEventB3-15"}},{"number":16,"nodeId":"CityEventB3-16","text":"Please don't call me Master.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB3-16","speaker":"{playerName}","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB3-17","speakerRef":{"speaker":1,"speakerImg":"Icon_Story_Me_1","position":"right","middleCharId":"dialog_npc_01"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEventB3-16"}},{"number":17,"nodeId":"CityEventB3-17","text":"You are not a slave any more and you can live your own life freely.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB3-17","speaker":"{playerName}","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB3-18","speakerRef":{"speaker":1,"speakerImg":"Icon_Story_Me_1","position":"right","middleCharId":"dialog_npc_01"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEventB3-17"}},{"number":18,"nodeId":"CityEventB3-18","text":"Freely…?","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB3-18","speaker":null,"speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB3-19","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"dialog_npc_01"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEventB3-18"}},{"number":19,"nodeId":"CityEventB3-19","text":"Yes! If you're willing, you can treat me as your family.","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB3-19","speaker":"{playerName}","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB3-20","speakerRef":{"speaker":1,"speakerImg":"Icon_Story_Me_2","position":"right","middleCharId":"dialog_npc_01"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEventB3-19"}},{"number":20,"nodeId":"CityEventB3-20","text":"Family…?","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB3-20","speaker":null,"speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB3-21","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"dialog_npc_01"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEventB3-20"}},{"number":21,"nodeId":"CityEventB3-21","text":"Yes, family! I'll protect you like I protect family!","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB3-21","speaker":"{playerName}","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB3-22","speakerRef":{"speaker":1,"speakerImg":"Icon_Story_Me_7","position":"right","middleCharId":"dialog_npc_01"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEventB3-21"}},{"number":22,"nodeId":"CityEventB3-22","text":"—! Yes! I will! I'm willing to live with {playerName}!","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB3-22","speaker":null,"speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"CityEventB3-23","speakerRef":{"position":"mid","middleCharId":"dialog_npc_01"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEventB3-22"}},{"number":23,"nodeId":"CityEventB3-23","text":"Great! Then from now on, let's support each other and live together, my first family in this new world!","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:CityEventB3-23","speaker":"{playerName}","speakerArt":null,"choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":null,"speakerRef":{"speaker":1,"speakerImg":"Icon_Story_Me_2","position":"right","middleCharId":"dialog_npc_01"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Hero_N","bgImgPackage":"Hero","voiceID":"CityEventB3-23"}}],"excerpt":false,"root":"CityEventB3-1","owner":"B3","omittedNext":[],"sourceField":"CityAssignEvent.dialog","speakerPolicy":"explicit current node only; no inherited NPC identity"},{"id":"opening:Opening7-1","characterId":"","title":"Apothecary — opening excerpt","category":"village","lines":[{"number":1,"nodeId":"Opening7-1","text":"What have we here? I believe this might just be the apothecary of my dreams!","sourceKey":"Dialog:context:Opening7-1","speaker":"Maxim","speakerArt":"/assets/roster/hero_2.webp","choiceLabel":null,"nextNode":"Opening7-2","speakerRef":{"position":"left","leftCharId":"hero_02"},"presentation":{"bgImg":"Bg_Story_Pharmacy","bgImgPackage":"Story","voiceID":"Opening7-1"}},{"number":2,"nodeId":"Opening7-2","text":"And these potions... So many varieties, and all of such high quality! I can make a 